      <title>OpenAI Arrest Raises AI Espionage Concerns</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-10-18/openai-arrest-raises-ai-espionage-concerns-video</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">5d406af5d9de9874a1b30ecd</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 12:27:37 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Morgan Meaker, a senior writer for Bloomberg Weekend, tells Bloomberg This Weekend about the arrest of an OpenAI engineer accused of planting a covert recording device in an executive conference room, a case highlighting growing concerns about protecting sensitive AI technology. Meaker also explains to hosts David Gura and Christina Ruffini how AI training work is shifting toward highly skilled experts and why that evolution could eventually reshape the professions providing that expertise. (Source: Bloomberg)</description>
